<view class="page"><scene-backdrop/><view class="title">分享这一场好球</view><view class="sub">有些时光，不必用成绩衡量。</view><picker class="share-background-picker" range="{{backgrounds}}" range-key="name" value="{{backgroundIndex}}" bindchange="background"><view class="card share-background-row row"><text>背景风景</text><view><text>{{backgrounds[backgroundIndex].name}}</text><text class="share-picker-arrow">⌄</text></view></view></picker><view class="note share-background-note">默认使用首页正在显示的风景，也可以单独选一张。</view><view class="choices"><view wx:for="{{themes}}" wx:key="id" class="choice {{index===index2?'active':''}}" wx:for-index="index2" data-i="{{index2}}" bindtap="theme">{{item.name}}</view></view><view class="row card"><text>附上我的成绩</text><switch checked="{{showScore}}" color="#226448" bindchange="toggle"/></view><view wx:if="{{busy}}" class="note">正在把这一刻，留在风景里…</view><image wx:if="{{path}}" class="postcard-preview" src="{{path}}" mode="widthFix" bindtap="preview"/><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="danger share-error">{{error}}<text class="link tap" bindtap="retry">点击重试</text></view><view class="toolbar"><button bindtap="save" disabled="{{!path}}">保存图片</button><button class="primary" open-type="share">邀请朋友，一起去走走</button></view><view class="note spaced">点开图片可全屏查看并长按保存。只分享你自己的成绩，不包含同组球友的记录。</view><canvas type="2d" id="postcard" class="postcard-canvas"/></view><privacy-panel/>
